[117.017228, "o", "before the prediction's `as_of`.  The original code ignored this timing constraint, causing\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[117.017252, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[117.017283, "o", "> "]
[117.01759, "o", "leakage.  The implementation below builds cumulative sums/counts per district and a global\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
